 "notes": [
  "Posted 21 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (9)': Rescue The Princess / Sometimes I Amaze Even Myself, Death Star: Detention Block Corridor, Leia Organa, Death Star: Docking Bay 327, Yavin 4: Docking Bay, Yavin 4: Massassi War Room, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Insurrection and Staging Areas; these count toward the 60. Insurrection and Staging Areas are both starting Effects pulled by Heading For The Medical Frigate, so no single starting effect is shown.",
  "Posted 'Death Star Detetion Block Corridor' dested the Light Special Edition site Death Star: Detention Block Corridor (the Premiere one is Dark); 'Yavin 4 War Room' Yavin 4: Massassi War Room.",
  "Posted 'Artoo' dested the Jabba's Palace character Artoo (Light); 'Weapon Levitation' the Light Jabba's Palace Interrupt (the Cloud City card of that name is Dark); 'Orimaarko' Orrimaarko.",
  "Posted 'Were Doomed' dested We're Doomed; 'Suprise Assault' Surprise Assault; 'Blast The Door, Kid' Blast The Door, Kid!; 'It's A Trap' It's A Trap!; 'Run Luke, Run' Run Luke, Run!.",
  "Insurrection and Staging Areas are the standalone Effects (the Reflections III combo Insurrection & Aim High came out later).",
  "The author's later Rescue The Princess list (September 2001) is a separate, different deck.",
  "Total is 60 as published."
